# Installation Complete

The IDP Estate has been installed on this Mac.

## Next steps

Open Terminal and run the full bootstrap:

    /usr/local/bin/idp-install-all

This installs Python 3.12 and configures all services.

## Services

- FleetView backend:  http://127.0.0.1:18790
- Executor daemon:     ~/.estate/executor.sock

## Uninstall

    sudo rm -rf /usr/local/idp /usr/local/bin/idp-install-all
    launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/ai.estate.fleetview-backend
